{
  "id": "RAW_363cc0ca29",
  "title": "AI Gateway 现已支持区域推理 - Vercel",
  "url": "https://vercel.com/changelog/regional-inference-now-available-on-ai-gateway",
  "date": "2026-07-28 03:00:00",
  "author": "Walter Korman, Rohan Taneja, Josh Lipman, Jerilyn Zheng",
  "siteName": "Vercel News",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-initial flex-col items-center justify-start gap-6\" data-customer-story=\"false\">\n   <div class=\"w-full max-w-(--article-max-width) contents [&amp;&gt;h2:first-child]:!pt-0 [&amp;&gt;h3:first-child]:!pt-0 [&amp;&gt;[data-geist-code-block]]:w-full [&amp;&gt;[data-geist-code-block]]:max-w-none [&amp;&gt;[data-geist-code-block]]:self-stretch\" data-blog-body=\"true\">\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">AI Gateway now supports regional inference. Set <code>inferenceRegion</code> on a request to pin it to the US or EU. Every model provider that supports the selected region handles it the same way. Inference runs there, and any data the provider keeps is stored there.</p>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">AI Gateway supports two pinned regions, plus global routing:</p>\n    <div class=\"scroller-module__aGa9CG__overlayContainer mb-10 mt-6 h-fit! max-w-[900px]! w-fit! @max-sm:my-2 @max-sm:-mx-6 @max-sm:w-[calc(100%+51px)]! scroller-module__aGa9CG__isHorizontal\" data-geist-scroller=\"\" data-version=\"v1\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%\">\n     <div class=\"scroller-module__aGa9CG__scroller rounded-xl border border-gray-alpha-400 @max-sm:rounded-none @max-sm:border-none\" data-geist-scroller-container=\"\" data-overflow=\"x\">\n      <div>\n       <table class=\"inline-block max-w-[900px]! bg-clip-padding shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-small)] @max-sm:rounded-none @max-sm:border-0 @max-sm:shadow-none [&amp;_tbody]:inline-block [&amp;_tbody]:-m-px [&amp;_tbody]:bg-background-100 @max-sm:[&amp;_tbody]:my-[-1px] @max-sm:[&amp;_tbody]:mb-2.5 @max-sm:[&amp;_tbody]:border-t @max-sm:[&amp;_tbody]:border-gray-400 @max-sm:[&amp;_tbody]:shadow-[0px_1px_2px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] [&amp;_th]:bg-background-200 [&amp;_th_*]:text-copy-16! [&amp;_th_*]:leading-6! [&amp;_th_*]:font-semibold [&amp;_th]:text-start [&amp;_td]:text-start [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_th]:border-gray-400 [&amp;_td]:border-gray-400 [&amp;_th]:px-6 [&amp;_th]:py-5 [&amp;_td]:px-6 [&amp;_td]:py-5 @max-sm:[&amp;_th]:min-w-[180px] @max-sm:[&amp;_td]:min-w-[180px] @max-sm:[&amp;_th]:p-4 @max-sm:[&amp;_td]:p-4 [&amp;_td_p]:inline-block [&amp;_td_p]:m-0 [&amp;_td_p]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_td_p]:leading-[140%] @max-sm:[&amp;_td_p]:text-copy-16 [&amp;_td_p_b]:font-medium [&amp;_th:first-child]:border-l-0 [&amp;_th:last-child]:border-r-0 [&amp;_tr:first-child_th]:border-t-0 @max-sm:[&amp;_tr:first-child_th]:border-t @max-sm:[&amp;_tr:first-child_th]:border-gray-400 [&amp;_tr:last-child_th]:border-b-0\">\n        <tbody>\n         <tr>\n          <th>\n           <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">Region<!-- --></p>\n          </th>\n          <th>\n           <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">Where inference runs</p>\n          </th>\n         </tr>\n         <tr>\n          <td>\n           <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\"><code>us</code></p>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n           <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">A US data center</p>\n          </td>\n         </tr>\n         <tr>\n          <td>\n           <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\"><code>eu</code></p>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n           <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">An EU data center</p>\n          </td>\n         </tr>\n         <tr>\n          <td>\n           <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\"><code>global</code></p>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n           <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">Any region</p>\n          </td>\n         </tr>\n        </tbody>\n       </table>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">If no model provider can serve it, the request fails rather than running somewhere else. Every response reports the region that served it, so you can confirm where each request ran.</p>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">Here's a request pinned to the US with the AI SDK:</p>\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col items-stretch justify-start gap-4 flex-initial blog-code-block-module__TEKDOa__wrapper\">\n     <div class=\"relative my-4 rounded-md border border-[var(--ds-gray-400)] overflow-hidden group/copy blog-code-block-module__TEKDOa__codeBlock\" data-geist-code-block=\"\">\n      <button type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-react-aria-pressable=\"true\" aria-label=\"Copy to clipboard\" data-testid=\"copy/button\" class=\"outline-none m-0 border-0 align-baseline no-underline group/trigger relative cursor-pointer select-none transform translate-z-0 flex text-[var(--themed-fg,_var(--ds-background-100))] bg-[var(--themed-bg,_var(--ds-gray-1000))] font-medium max-w-full items-center justify-center transition-[border-color, background,color,transform,box-shadow] duration-[time:150ms] ease-in-out data-[focus]:shadow-[var(--ds-focus-ring)] [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed aria-disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:text-[var(--ds-gray-700)] disabled:bg-[var(--ds-gray-100)] aria-disabled:text-[var(--ds-gray-700)] aria-disabled:bg-[var(--ds-gray-100)] disabled:![--themed-border:_var(--ds-gray-400)] [--x-padding:10px] [--height:var(--ds-size-medium)] text-[14px] !px-0 rounded-md [--themed-bg:_var(--ds-background-100)] shadow-[0_0_0_1px_var(--themed-border,_transparent)] [--themed-hover-bg:_var(--ds-gray-alpha-200)] [--themed-fg:_var(--ds-gray-1000)] [--themed-border:_var(--ds-gray-400)] data-[focus]:shadow-[0_0_0_1px_var(--themed-border,_transparent),0_0_0_2px_var(--ds-background-100),0_0_0_4px_var(--ds-focus-color)] data-[focus]:transition-none p-0 w-[var(--geist-form-height)] h-[var(--geist-form-height)] data-hover:bg-[var(--ds-gray-100)] dark-theme:data-hover:bg-[var(--ds-gray-200)] data-hover:text-[var(--themed-fg)] data-hover:disabled:bg-[var(--ds-gray-100)] !size-8 !rounded-[5px] [&amp;_svg]:!text-[var(--ds-gray-900)] !absolute top-[min(16%,16px)] right-4 opacity-0 group-hover/copy:opacity-100 focus:opacity-100 z-1 !bg-[var(--ds-background-200)]\" data-geist-button=\"\" data-prefix=\"false\" data-suffix=\"false\" data-version=\"v1\" style=\"--geist-icon-size:16px\"><span class=\"truncate px-1.5 inline-flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\"> \n        <div class=\"relative size-4\">\n         <div class=\"absolute transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out opacity-0 scale-50\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" data-slot=\"geist-icon\" style=\"color:currentColor\">\n           <path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"m15.56 4-.53.53-8.8 8.8c-.68.68-1.78.68-2.47 0l.53-.54-.53.53-2.79-2.79L.44 10 1.5 8.94l.53.53 2.8 2.8c.1.09.25.09.35 0l8.79-8.8.53-.53z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n          </svg>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"absolute transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out opacity-100 scale-100\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" data-slot=\"geist-icon\" style=\"color:currentColor\">\n           <path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M8.25 2c.14 0 .25.11.25.25V3H10v-.75C10 1.28 9.22.5 8.25.5h-5.5C1.78.5 1 1.28 1 2.25v7.5c0 .97.78 1.75 1.75 1.75H4.5V10H2.75a.25.25 0 0 1-.25-.25v-7.5c0-.14.11-.25.25-.25zm5 4c.14 0 .25.11.25.25v7.5q-.02.23-.25.25h-5.5a.25.25 0 0 1-.25-.25v-7.5c0-.14.11-.25.25-.25zm0 9.5c.97 0 1.75-.78 1.75-1.75v-7.5c0-.97-.78-1.75-1.75-1.75h-5.5C6.78 4.5 6 5.28 6 6.25v7.5c0 .97.78 1.75 1.75 1.75z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n          </svg>\n         </div>\n        </div> \n       </span></button>\n      <pre class=\"prism-code language-typescript code-block-module__vF3MAa__pre\"><code class=\"text-[var(--ds-gray-1000)] text-left whitespace-pre break-normal !text-[13px] leading-[20px] font-mono hyphens-none\" style=\"font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off\" data-geist-code-block=\"true\"><div class=\"line\" data-geist-code-block-line=\"true\" id=\"C14ae425d-L1\" data-highlighted=\"false\" style=\"font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off\"><div class=\"token-line\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token plain\"> streamText </span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token keyword\">from</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token string\">'ai'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span></div></div><div class=\"line\" data-geist-code-block-line=\"true\" id=\"C14ae425d-L2\" data-highlighted=\"false\" style=\"font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off\"><div class=\"token-line\"><span class=\"token plain\" style=\"display:inline-block\">\n</span></div></div><div class=\"line\" data-geist-code-block-line=\"true\" id=\"C14ae425d-L3\" data-highlighted=\"false\" style=\"font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off\"><div class=\"token-line\"><span class=\"token plain\"></span><span class=\"token keyword\">const</span><span class=\"token plain\"> result </span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token function\">streamText</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span></div></div><div class=\"line\" data-geist-code-block-line=\"true\" id=\"C14ae425d-L4\" data-highlighted=\"false\" style=\"font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off\"><div class=\"token-line\"><span class=\"token plain\">  model</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token string\">'moonshotai/kimi-k3'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span></div></div><div class=\"line\" data-geist-code-block-line=\"true\" id=\"C14ae425d-L5\" data-highlighted=\"false\" style=\"font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off\"><div class=\"token-line\"><span class=\"token plain\">  prompt</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token string\">'Summarize this internal document.'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span></div></div><div class=\"line\" data-geist-code-block-line=\"true\" id=\"C14ae425d-L6\" data-highlighted=\"false\" style=\"font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off\"><div class=\"token-line\"><span class=\"token plain\">  providerOptions</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span></div></div><div class=\"line\" data-geist-code-block-line=\"true\" id=\"C14ae425d-L7\" data-highlighted=\"false\" style=\"font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off\"><div class=\"token-line\"><span class=\"token plain\">    gateway</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span></div></div><div class=\"line\" data-geist-code-block-line=\"true\" id=\"C14ae425d-L8\" data-highlighted=\"true\" style=\"font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off\"><div class=\"token-line\"><span class=\"token plain\">      inferenceRegion</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token plain\"> scope</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token string\">'zone'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span><span class=\"token plain\"> geoRegion</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token string\">'us'</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span></div></div><div class=\"line\" data-geist-code-block-line=\"true\" id=\"C14ae425d-L9\" data-highlighted=\"false\" style=\"font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off\"><div class=\"token-line\"><span class=\"token plain\">    </span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span></div></div><div class=\"line\" data-geist-code-block-line=\"true\" id=\"C14ae425d-L10\" data-highlighted=\"false\" style=\"font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off\"><div class=\"token-line\"><span class=\"token plain\">  </span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span></div></div><div class=\"line\" data-geist-code-block-line=\"true\" id=\"C14ae425d-L11\" data-highlighted=\"false\" style=\"font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off\"><div class=\"token-line\"><span class=\"token plain\"></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></div></div></code></pre>\n     </div>\n     <p class=\"text-center text-copy-14 text-gray-900\"></p>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">Until now, teams with data residency or compliance requirements had to configure regional routing separately for every provider, with no reliable way to confirm where a request actually ran. Regional inference replaces that with a single field that behaves the same everywhere and a response that tells you where each request was served.</p>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">Filter the <a href=\"https://vercel.com/ai-gateway/models\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_self\" data-track=\"true\" data-track-click-name=\"article_link\" data-track-click-value=\"https://vercel.com/ai-gateway/models\" data-zone=\"null\" class=\"cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-2 outline-[var(--ds-focus-color)] outline-offset-4 text-[var(--geist-link-color)] [:not([aria-disabled])]:hover:underline [&amp;_u]:no-underline underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 text-inherit! hover:decoration-1! hover:text-(--geist-link-color)! focus-visible:outline-offset-2\">model list</a> for models available in the US or EU, or read the <code>regions</code> array from <code>/v1/models</code>. Without <code>inferenceRegion</code>, requests route globally with no residency guarantee, so residency is opt-in.</p>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">Pinning a region can cost more. The provider sets the regional rate, often around 10% above standard, and AI Gateway passes it through with no markup. For per-provider overrides, response verification, pricing, and BYOK behavior, read the <a href=\"https://vercel.com/docs/ai-gateway/security-and-compliance/regional-inference\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_self\" data-track=\"true\" data-track-click-name=\"article_link\" data-track-click-value=\"https://vercel.com/docs/ai-gateway/security-and-compliance/regional-inference\" data-zone=\"null\" class=\"cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-2 outline-[var(--ds-focus-color)] outline-offset-4 text-[var(--geist-link-color)] [:not([aria-disabled])]:hover:underline [&amp;_u]:no-underline underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 text-inherit! hover:decoration-1! hover:text-(--geist-link-color)! focus-visible:outline-offset-2\">regional inference documentation</a>.</p>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "Vercel AI Gateway 现已支持区域推理，允许开发者将 AI 请求固定在美国或欧盟，以满足数据驻留和合规性要求。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "Vercel AI Gateway 现已支持区域推理，允许开发者将 AI 请求固定在美国或欧盟，以满足数据驻留和合规性要求。",
  "summary": "Vercel 为其 AI Gateway 引入了区域推理，用户可以指定 `inferenceRegion`（us、eu 或 global），确保请求在特定地理区域内处理并存储数据。此功能通过在不同模型提供商之间提供统一配置来简化合规性，并包含响应验证以确认服务区域。虽然驻留是自愿选择的，可能会产生由提供商设定的额外费用（通常约为 10%），但它消除了对每个提供商进行区域路由配置的需求。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
      "point": "统一的 AI 推理区域路由。",
      "explanation": "开发者现在可以使用单一的 `inferenceRegion` 字段，将请求固定在美国或欧盟，适用于所有受支持的模型提供商，取代了零散的每个提供商的配置。"
    },
    {
      "point": "强化的合规性与验证。",
      "explanation": "该功能通过在所选区域运行推理并存储数据来确保数据驻留，并在每个响应中明确报告服务区域，以实现可审计性。"
    },
    {
      "point": "自愿选择的驻留功能，可能带来成本影响。",
      "explanation": "区域固定是自愿选择的功能；未指定区域的请求将全局路由。用户可能会因模型提供商对区域托管设置的费用（约 10%）而面临价格上涨。"
    }
  ],
  "keyQuotes": [
    "直到现在，拥有数据驻留或合规性要求的团队必须为每个提供商单独配置区域路由，且没有可靠的方法确认请求实际运行的位置。"
  ],
